sequenceDiagram
    participant TaskModal
    participant TaskObserver
    participant Job as SyncOutboundGitHubIssueJob
    participant GH as GitHub API
    participant WH as /webhooks/github
    participant Handler as ProcessGitHubWebhookJob

    TaskModal->>TaskObserver: save task
    TaskObserver->>Job: dispatch if needs_sync
    Job->>GH: PATCH /repos/{f}/issues/{n}
    GH->>WH: POST webhook (issues event)
    WH->>Handler: dispatch (signature verified, deduped)
    Handler->>Handler: md5 incoming content vs last_synced_hash
    alt hashes match
        Handler-->>Handler: skip (echo protection)
    else
        Handler->>TaskModal: broadcast TaskUpdated
    end
